{"ID":"20230928082053-niy1byg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230928082053-niy1byg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082053-niy1byg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082059-63w56ho\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082124-66yn7ir\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230928082124-66yn7ir\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"【耳针】★","type":"doc","updated":"20230928082124"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230928082059-63w56ho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082059-63w56ho","updated":"20230928082059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每天按摩整个耳朵二十分钟，百病不生；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082059-e1owzai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082059-e1owzai","updated":"20230928082059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳朵像人，所以按揉耳朵能让五脏运动；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082059-fqt6nlv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082059-fqt6nlv","updated":"20230928082059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"找阿是穴，然后在阿是穴上埋耳针，一般耳针可以在耳朵埋六天，夏天短一点，因为流汗四五天，冬天可以埋时间长点；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082059-2wtjszx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082059-2wtjszx","updated":"20230928082059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"埋针过程中尽量保持干燥，沾到水容易发炎，沾水就取出；"}]},{"ID":"20230928082100-7o43xx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082100-7o43xx6"}},{"ID":"20230928082124-66yn7ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230928082124-66yn7ir","updated":"20230928082124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"耳针图"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/耳针图-20230928082124-l43uya1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}